@startuml Fluxo: Criar Ordem de Serviço
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Sequence.puml

actor Rec as "👤 Recepcionista"
participant API as "API"
participant Service as "ServiceOrderService"
participant ClientRepo as "ClientRepository"
participant OrderRepo as "ServiceOrderRepository"
participant DB as "🗄️ PostgreSQL"
participant Cache as "💾 Redis"
participant Email as "📧 Email"

== 1️⃣ Recepcionista Cria Ordem ==

Rec ->> API: POST /service-orders\n{clientId, vehicle, serviceType,\ndescription, scheduledDate}
activate API

== 2️⃣ Validação Inicial ==

API ->> Service: createServiceOrder(data)
activate Service

Service ->> Service: validate(data)\n✓ clientId exists\n✓ serviceType valid\n✓ date not in past
note right of Service: Validações de entrada

== 3️⃣ Verifica Cliente ==

Service ->> ClientRepo: findById(clientId)
activate ClientRepo

ClientRepo ->> DB: SELECT * FROM clients\nWHERE id = $1
activate DB
DB -->> ClientRepo: Client{...}
deactivate DB

ClientRepo -->> Service: Client{status: ACTIVE}
deactivate ClientRepo

note right of Service: Cliente existe e está ATIVO ✓

== 4️⃣ Estima Preço ==

Service ->> Service: estimatePrice(serviceType)\nBusca tabela_precos\nBase: R$ 450,00
note right of Service: Cálculo baseado\nem tipo de serviço

== 5️⃣ Cria Ordem no BD ==

Service ->> OrderRepo: create(orderData)
activate OrderRepo

OrderRepo ->> DB: INSERT INTO service_orders\n(client_id, vehicle_plate, service_type,\nstatus, estimated_price, scheduled_date,\ncreated_by, created_at)\nVALUES (...)
activate DB
DB -->> OrderRepo: ✓ order_id: 789
deactivate DB

note right of OrderRepo: Status inicial: PENDING

== 6️⃣ Invalida Cache ==

OrderRepo ->> Cache: invalidate('orders:all')
activate Cache
OrderRepo ->> Cache: invalidate('client:123:orders')
Cache -->> OrderRepo: OK
deactivate Cache

OrderRepo -->> Service: ServiceOrder{id: 789, ...}
deactivate OrderRepo

== 7️⃣ Email de Confirmação ==

Service ->> Email: send(client.email,\n'order-created')\nSubject: "Ordem #789 Criada"
activate Email

Email -->> Service: ✓ queued
deactivate Email

note right of Email: Template com:\n- Número da ordem\n- Tipo de serviço\n- Data agendada\n- Preço estimado

== 8️⃣ Publica Evento ==

Service ->> Service: publishEvent('ORDER_CREATED')\n{orderId: 789, clientId: 123}
note right of Service: Listeners podem reagir\n(ex: atualizar dashboard)

== 9️⃣ Resposta Final ==

Service -->> API: ServiceOrder{id: 789,\nstatus: PENDING, ...}
deactivate Service

API -->> Rec: 201 Created\n{order data}
deactivate API

Rec -->> Rec: ✓ Ordem #789 criada\nEmail enviado

note over Email: 📧 Email envia em background\nDashboard atualiza em tempo real\n(WebSocket)

== Fluxo de Erro (Cliente suspenso) ==

Note over Service: ❌ Se cliente.status = SUSPENDED:

Service -->> API: Error 422\n"Cliente suspenso não pode\nagendar serviços"
API -->> Rec: 422 Unprocessable Entity

== Performance Esperada ==

Note over Rec: ⏱️ Timings\nValidação: ~50ms\nCliente lookup (cache): ~20ms\nEstimar preço: ~30ms\nINSERT ordem: ~100ms\nInvalidar cache: ~30ms\nEmail enqueue: ~10ms\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTotal: ~240ms

@enduml
